  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/sv/questions\">Vanliga frågor</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/selling\">Sälja</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>Hur vet jag om ni kan sälja mitt fordon?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">Hur vet jag om ni kan sälja mitt fordon?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p>Det absolut lättaste är att ta kontakt med oss direkt. Skicka in ditt fordons registreringsnummer <a href=\"/sv/sales_inquiries/new\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> här</a> eller skicka ett mail till <a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> support@biddershighway.com</a> så återkommer vi inom kort.</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorier</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/sv/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alla frågor</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Köpa</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Sälja</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Budgivning</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/docum